uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o4tk071mV_MQ7kNvwEcbaVx&_nc_oc=Adrf4R_OS72XFCJsobHpuuupXNEeefyMV6zh_NTC-keeTtfRh8hVSR_WGgKOcX_9sgk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyEEozC22JgqQrgphWyU9XbFNBGSyNqEjPWbVDTt-ZWmg&oe=69CBDDA4"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W_ZgJe6bdw4Q7kNvwFp8Xfg&_nc_oc=Adqe8B6xZw2gdXhhLMPpy0ahpOSzWDhCIk18tImln2MsPegcoI457E5GbrvIRb1arQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwfrF7gDdzdoBnGS-5OTlzykPtAa_xuN67JHlPpUIShRA&oe=69CBC12C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MhhvjQ9j9WcQ7kNvwFDOiW5&_nc_oc=Adqt30Pc5rKNpeszXc0JxYi0_NJwvK0M8bV0zky_r-1B-suX1sAZuF1q5sIOP5e5b-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwMuFGox_lJabLSHz9i3OIuEhs828Cvb7PMpNo7dUXBfA&oe=69CBC01C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1l1KpSRaljkQ7kNvwG7uWgx&_nc_oc=AdrzNH2-1Y9Zz3Bp5vm-VYv01FMi1vhExnRRFhLilbyMvVCrl2X3JXXd2xqjWx0-WhY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwwzLiVkkykbd4Nbvm5rbqJQSBQtvzxHfAd9tppVGX9zA&oe=69CBB39D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hJ7jc2Cp1xkQ7kNvwFeyV17&_nc_oc=AdppUrO1xQHlD7s4uz97y6Y9yC-X3Y5Z5wA7oOpHss4yt0KatcC0G5W4T-nJoBRqLYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw95H4toOVCTdpd-rADd9LToPjpRJl9IOVj9_Zy_NmkkQ&oe=69CBB8CF"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "devel